ly considering the  incredible visuals it could have led to  feels  criminal  theo rossi has a knack for getting  memorable roles with unique nicknames on  sons of anarchy rossi played the biker  juice while on luke cage he played one  of the series most interesting crooks  shades in the first season shades is  fairly low in the stokes crime family  pecking order but even then there's a  lot going on behind the lenses of his  namesake while people like cottonmouth  played by mahershala ali and mariah  dillard played by alfred woodard may be  the one sitting on harlem's throne at  any given time it shades manipulating  things behind the curtain in the second  season shades moves up the ladder owing  in no small part to his romance with  dillard his cool facade finally cracks  when dillard forces him to kill his true  love comanche played by thomas q jones  it puts him on the path of betraying  dillard but he remains the same  charismatic cool bad guy to the end of  the series  few characters seem to bounce back and  forth between friend and enemy as much  as will simpson played by will traval  does in the first season of jessica  jones his complex journey is as  compelling as it is tumultuous  introduced as a policeman manipulated to  attack trish walker by the mind-bending  abilities of kilgrave simpson tries to  make things up to his victim once he's  free of kilgrave's influence simpson  eventually wins walker's trust but his  road to redemption takes dark turns we  learned that in the military simpson was  a part of some scary experiments  including being given drugs to enhance  his abilities and he begins taking those  drugs once more while they may help him  physically the drugs wreck his sanity  putting him on a collision course with  jessica will reappears in season 2 but  he doesn't last long once again trying  to make up for his crimes simpson tries  to protect trish but he's killed by  jessica's mother  in some ways you could say davos played  by sasha dew